<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- Nkangala New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">Vahevelu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda kuli Vahevelu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Vahevelu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Vahe</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda kuli</para>
  <para style="mt1">VAHEVELU</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukanda ua Vahevelu uapua mukanda uakusimpisa uje umuesa vati muje Yesu uashulisisile vunanguizi vuavuingi vua mu Litavasano Lialaja. Va usonekele ngue vilongesa via kuambulula. Mu mukanda ou ua Vahevelu muli vimueso viakupua makumi atanu na limo (60) viamu Litavasano Lialaja vije vimuesa cilivene muje vati Yesu uashulisisile vunanguizi na vipangi via kasasendote uakama ua Vayunda. Muomu ya cuma eci ou mukanda uapuile ua kusimpisa vu Kilistu vua Vayunda. Mukanda ua Vahevelu umuesa vati muje Yesu uamanuisile Lishiko lia Mosesa linga vasasendote keti vakahaneho naua vinkombelo. Yesu ikeye uapuile nkombelo ya vipi vioshe ya lumo lika ku vintsimbu vioshe. Vu Kilistu vua ntsimbu ino, yetu navakevo tuasa kuuana kusimpa mu mukanda ou ua Vahevelu mukutualelaho kuniunga na kukavangeya Yesu Kilistu uje ikeye umo lika muka kutuasiuisa linga tutsiliele muli Njambi, na kutualelelaho naua kutsiliela muli ikeye 12:2.</para>
  <para style="ip">Naumo uahi azivuka iya uasonekele Vahevelu, vuno honi vaka kulilongesa vanayongola nguavo hamo kanganda Paulu, cipue Luka, cipue Mbanambase. Na ntsimbu ije ivausonekele nayo naua naumo uahi ayizivuka, vuno honi vavengi vatsiliela ngeci vausonekele mu miaka makumi atanu na avali (70) hanima ya kusemuka ca Yesu. Yelusalema vaisiuile mu miaka makumi atanu na avali (70), vuno honi muka kusoneka ou mukanda ikeye ahandeka ngue Yelusalema tele kanda vaisiule. Mukanda ua Vahevelu vausonekelele mu nganda ya Loma (13:24) kaha cilivene uasele kushandokela mu vikungulukilo viavingi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Muvana vitumbikilamo</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Muka kusoneka amuesa ngeci Yesu ikeye nahiana tunanguizi na tungelo (1:1; 4:13)</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Ambahoni uatualelelaho kumuesa ngeci Yesu ikeye nahiana vasasendote vaje vapanga mu njivo ya Njambi mu Yelusalema (4:14; 7:28)</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Naua cipangi ca Yesu cinahiana litavasano lialaja lije Njambi ualingile kuhitila mu Lishiko lije liahanene kuli Mosesa (8:1; 10:31)</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Hanima ya kulumbununa ngeci Yesu ikeye nahiana mu vingila vioshe, muka kusoneka ou mukanda ahana vishika via vilinga viavingi (10:32; 13:17)</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Cakumanusuila muka kusoneka amanesa mukanda uendi mu kusimpisa na mukumeneka 13:18-25</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s">Lizi lia Njambi kuhitila muli Munendi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Mu vuingi na mu vingila viakuliseza seza Njambi uahandekele vialaja kuli vatatetu kuhitila muli tunanguizi, <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />vuno honi mu matangua ano amamanusuilo nahandeka kuli yetu kuhitila muli Munendi, uje yahanguile kuyula viuma vioshe, kuhitila muli ikeye naua uatangele mavu. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Alinakumuesa vumpau vua Njambi na ikeye vene kaha nambata cifua ca Njambi, nakukuata lilu na lizi liendi lia nzili. Hanima yakukusha vipi, kaha uatumamene ku livoko lia cilio lia Mukanzili yoshe.<verse eid="HEB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vukama vua Muna Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Hakupuako uakama mukuhiana ku tungelo ngue ku lizina liatambuile liapuile liakama cikuma kupulakana avo.<verse eid="HEB 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Nkuma ku kangelo muka kuje Njambi uahandekele nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Yove unapu Munange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">lelo njinapu yange Isho?” Cipue naua,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Njikapua nji Ishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">kaha akapua Munange?”<verse eid="HEB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Kaha naua, omo aneha muana ua ntuatua hano ha mavu, kaha ahandeka nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">“Eceleni voshe tungelo va Njambi vamulemese.”<verse eid="HEB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Ku tungelo ahandeka nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">“Iya muka kulinga tungelo vendi kuvapuisa mpunzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">kaha na vangamba vendi kuvapuisa milengi ya tuhia.”<verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />Vuno honi kuli Muana ahandeka nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">“Litanda liove, yove Njambi liapua lia yaye!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">Mbueti ya vusunga ya muene yapua mbueti ya vumuene vuendi.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Kaha uazanga vusunga nakuzinda vupi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">nankuma Njambi, Njambi yove nakuvuavesa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">na mazi akujolela kupulakana vakueni.”<verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />Kaha uahandekele naua nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">“Yove Muene, hambangelo uatangele mavu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">na melu apua vipangi via mavoko ove.<verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Vikanonga, vuno honi yove ukasala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">vioshe vikakuluvala ngue vuzalo vua laja.<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />Ukavaheteka ngue kazaku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">kaha vakalumuka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Vuno honi yove ukapua muje vene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">kaha na miaka yove kuikahu.”<verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />Nkuma ku kangelo muka kuje uahandekele nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">“Tumama ku livoko liange lia cilio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">noho njikalinga vitozi vove</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">cituamo ca viliato viove?”<verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Nkuma keti tungelo voshe vaje va vipangi via vimbembesi vakevo vavakatumu kupanga, muomu ya mulonga ua vaje vakatambula kuovoka ndi?<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuovoka cakama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Nankuma tunapande kuvuilila cikuma kuli evi tunevu, linga keti tuhume ku viuma evi. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Muomu nga muzimbu uvahandekele tungelo uapuile ua vusunga kaha uoshe uje kaukavangeyele nakuhona kuuononoka uatambuile kashitiko kaje kamupande, <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />nkuma tukateua vati nga tuviana kuovoka eci cakama? Vacihandekele kuli Muene ha kulivanga, kaha vatulekeleco kuli vaje vamuvuile, <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />tele Njambi naua ali nakuhana vukaleho vua vimueso na vipupu na vikomoueso viakuliseza seza na mavuana a Cimbembesi Uakulela nahana kuya ku cizango cendi.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uje muka kututuamenena ku kuovoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Muomu keti ku tungelo Njambi uahanene linga vakayule mavu aje alinakuija, evi vikevio vije tuli nakuhandeka. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Kuli kumo mu visoneka vanacihandeka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">“Muntu uapua iya linga yove umusinganieke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">cipue Muna Muntu linga umuhakele mana?<verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />Uamupangele muka ntsimbu kakandende lika muintsi lia tungelo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:7">uamuzikile cilongo ca vumpau na kasingimiko,<verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />vahakele viuma vioshe muintsi lia viliato viendi.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Honi hakuhaka viuma vioshe linga avisuane, kasezeleko na cimo cije kasuanene. Ha ntsimbu ino ni, kanda tumone vioshe kupua muntsi liendi. <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />Vuno honi tuamono Yesu, uje muka ntsimbu kakandende vamulingile kukala muintsi lia tungelo, na kumuzika cilongo ca vumpau na kasingimiko muomu ya tuyando tua kutsa, ngeci ha kavumbi ka Njambi atsile vantu voshe.<verse eid="HEB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Muomu camupandele ngeci Njambi, kuhitila muli ikeye na hali ikeye viuma vioshe vikaleko, mukuneha vana vavengi ku vumpau, muomu kuhitila mu kuyanda cendi akava tuamenena ku kuovoka ca vusunga. <verse eid="HEB 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Muomu ikeye muka kulelesa kaha na vaje vavalelesa voshe vanapu vaka ntanga imo lika. Muomu yeci mukemo kevu shuamua muku vatumbula nguendi vamuanetu, <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />nahandeka naua nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">“Njikahandeka lizina liove kuli vamuanetu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">mukati ka cikungulukilo njikakushangazala.”<verse eid="HEB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />Kaha naua nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">“Njikahaka kutsiliela cange muli ikeye.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:13">Kaha naua nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">“Yange uno, hamo na vana vaje Njambi nanjihana.”<verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Nankuma, muomu vana vaje valipangela muvila na maninga, na ikeye vavenia naua uambateleko cifua cimo ca vuntu, ngeci kuhitila mukutsa cendi linga anongese uje ali na nzili ya kutsa, ikeye uje Liyavolo, <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />nakupatula voshe vaje vakele na liova lia kutsa na kuyoya vuyoye vua vundungo. <verse eid="HEB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />Cilivene keti tungelo nahakela mana vuno honi vatekuluila va Avilahama. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Nankuma vamupangele mucifua cimo lika na vamunaina mu cifua coshe ngeci apue ua cikeketima na kasasendote uakama ua kulongua mu cipangi ca Njambi, nakupua nkombelo ya fueto yakukonekela vipi via vantu. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Muomu ikeye vavenia uayandele na kumueseka, kaha asa kukuasa vaje vali mu vieseko.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu uapua uakama cikuma kupulakana Mosesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Nankuma, vamuanetu vakulela, vaje tulipangela mukusana ca muilu, yongoleni Yesu, kanganda na kasasendote uakama mukutava cetu. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />Uapuile uakulongua kuli uje uamuhanguile, ngue muje Mosesa uapuile uakulongua mu njivo ya Njambi. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Yesu alina kasingimiko kakama cikuma ka vumpau kupulakana Mosesa, ngue muka kutunga njivo ali nakasingimiko cikuma kupulakana njivo. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />(Muomu njivo yoshe vaitunga ku muntu, vuno honi muka kutunga viuma vioshe uapua Njambi) <verse eid="HEB 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Honi Mosesa uapuile uakulongua ku vioshe mu njivo ya Njambi hakupuako ngamba, hakuhana vukaleho ku viuma vije vakahandeka kulutue, <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />vuno honi Kilistu uapuile uakulongua mu njivo ya Njambi hakupua Muana. Kaha yetu tunapu njivo yendi nga tukakateya mukusimpa cetu na kulihalesa mukutsiliela cetu.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhuima ca vantu va Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />Nankuma, ngue muahandeka Cimbembesi Uakulela nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">“Lelo, omo muvua lizi liendi,<verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />keti mukolese mitima yeni ngue vaje vaka kutengulukila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">ngue ha litangua lia vieseko mu mpambo,<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />kuje vakukuluila veni vanjesekele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">kaha vamuene vipangi viange ha miaka makumi auana.<verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />Nankuma, njanienguelele ntanga ije,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:10">kaha njahandekele nguange, ‘Ntsimbu yoshe mitima yavo ili kulahako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">kuvazivukile vingila viange.’<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Ngue muje njalisingile mu vutenu vuange nguange,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:11">‘Kuvakakovela mukuhuima cange!’”<verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Liniungeni vamuanetu, keti umo hakati keni akale na vupi, mutima uakuhona kutsiliela, uje umihumisa kuli Njambi ua kuyoya. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Vuno honi munapande kulikolesa umo na mukuavo ha litangua na litangua, lije livatumbula nguavo “lelo,” nga mulinga evi naumo uahi ueni ivakakuisa na vupi na kupua uakukaluua. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Muomu tuva voshe tuli nakupangela hamo muli Kilistu, nga lika tukakateya ku kusimpa cetu cakulivanga kuheta nakuntsongo, <verse eid="HEB 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />Ngue muje vacihandeka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">“Lelo, omo muvua lizi liendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">keti mukolese mitima yeni ngue mumualingile mukutengulukila Njambi.”<verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />Nkuma veya vaje vovuile kaha vamutengulukilile? Nkuma kuvapuile voshe vaje vahumine mu Ingito vaje vakele nakutuamenena Mosesa ndi? <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Nkuma veya vaje Njambi uanienguelele ha miaka makumi auana? Nkuma keti vaje valingile vupi, vaje vatsililile mu mpambo ndi? <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Kaha nkuma kuli veya vaje ualisingile nguendi kuvakakovela mukuhuima cendi, vuno honi nkuma keti kuli vaje kuva muononokele ndi? <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Nankuma tumona nguetu kuvasele kukovela muomu yakuhona kutsiliela cavo.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Nankuma, muomu cikulaheso cije cakukakovela mukuhuima cendi hanga kucili, tuyeni tuliniunge ngeci naumo uahi ueni akahonoue kuhetako. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Muomu Muzimbu Uacili uezile kuli yetu ngue muje naua muuezile kuli vakevo, vuno honi muzimbu uje uvovuile ku uavakuasele, muomu ku ua litavasanene na lutsilielo lua vaje vauvuile. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Honi yetu vaje tunatsiliela tukakovela mu kuhuima cije, ngue muje nahandeka nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">“Ngue muje njalisingile mu vutenu vuange nguange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">‘Ku vakakovela mukuhuima cange!’”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Cipue vene vipangi viendi viahuile hume haluvula lua mavu. <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />Muomu ikeye umo uje kuvisoneka vimo nahandeka ha litangua lia Sapalalo mu ngila eyi nguendi, “Kaha Njambi uahuimine ha litangua lia Sapalalo ku vipangi viendi vioshe.” <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Kaha naua mu cihela eci uahandekele nguendi, “Kuvakakovela mukuhuima cange.” <verse eid="HEB 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Nankuma hanga kuasala vamo vakakovelamo mukuhuima cije, kaha vaje vatambuile Muzimbu Uacili ha kulivanga vahonouele kukovela mukuhuima cije muomu yakuhona kuononoka cavo, <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />kaha naua Njambi uahanguile litangua likuavo, “Lelo,” nguendi kuhitila muli Ndaviti laja kunima, mu mezi muje vanahandeka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">“Lelo, omo muvua lizi liendi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:7">keti mukolese mitima yeni.”<verse eid="HEB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Muomu nga Yoshua uavahanene kuhuima, ngue Njambi kahandekele naua litangua likuavo. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Nankuma honi Sapalalo inasala ngoco vene litangua liakuhuima lia vantu va Njambi. <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Muomu uoshe uje akovela mukuhuima ca Njambi ecela kuvipangi viendi ngue muje mualingile Njambi kuvipangi viendi. <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Nankuma tuyeni tueseke muoshe mutuaselamo ngeci tukakovele mukuhuima cije, linga naumo uahi akahonoue ngue muje muvalingile vakevo ha kuhona kuononoka cavo.<verse eid="HEB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Muomu lizi lia Njambi lili nakuyoya na kupanga, nakuvambuka kupulakana mpoko ya mukuale ya vutuesi kuvali, lituva lihangununo lia muono na cimbembesi, na manunga na vusoso, likasompo viyongola na vilinga via mutima. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Kaha kuli ikeye na cimo cahi cakutanga capua cakushueka, vuno honi vioshe viapua via kufukuka kaha viakala hakutoka ku mesho endi, nakuli uje tutonda kuvilinga.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ikeye Kasasendote Uakama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Nankuma honi tuli na kasasendote uakama cikuma uje nahiti melu oshe, Yesu, Muna Njambi, tukakateyeni na kulitava cetu. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Muomu kutuesi na kasasendote uakama uje kasa kutetela kuzeya cetu, vuno honi tuli na umo uje mu vingila vioshe vamuesekele ngue yetu naua, kuakuhona vupi. <verse eid="HEB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Ambahoni tuyeni na kusimpa tushuene ku litanda lia Njambi lia kavumbi, linga tutambule cikeketima na kuuana kavumbi kaje katukuasa ha ntsimbu ije tukajena.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Muomu uoshe kasasendote uakama vanamuhangula hakati ka vantu na kumuimika linga apangele vantu mu vipangi via Njambi, kuhana mavuana na kulinga vinkombelo via vipi. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Na mutima ua kulikehesa asa kukuasa vaje vaka nzimba na vaka kuvulumuna milonga, muomu na ikeye vavenia uapua uakuzeya. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Muomu yeci nalihana kukombelela nkombelo ya vipi viendi vavenia na via vantu. <verse eid="HEB 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Kaha na umo uahi asa kulihana kasingimiko ikeye vavenia, vuno honi nga Njambi na musana, ngue muasanene Alone.<verse eid="HEB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Nankuma mungila imo vene Kilistu kalijunduile ikeye vavenia kulipuisa kasasendote uakama cikuma, vuno honi vamuhanguile kuli ikeye uje uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">“Yove unapu u Munange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">lelo njinapu nji Isho,”<verse eid="HEB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />ngue muahandeka naua mu cihela cikuavo nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">“Yove ukapua ukasasendote ua yaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">ngue muje muapuile Melekizendeki.”<verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Mu matangua a vuntu vuendi, Yesu ualombelele nakuihula, na lizi liakutambeka na masozi, kuli uje asa kumuovola ku kutsa, kaha vamuvuile muomu ikeye uakele nakuvuila Njambi liova. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Cipue vene uapuile Muana, vuno honi ualilongesele kuononoka kuhitila muje muayandelelemo, <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />hakupua uakulela ikeye uapuile ntsina ya kuovoka ca yaye kuli voshe vaje va muononoka, <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />hakumusholola kuli Njambi kupua kasasendote uakama ngue muje muapuile Melekizendeki.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cinangulo caha kuseza Lutsilielo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Ha cuma eci tuli na viavingi viakuhandeka vije naua viavikalu kulumbununa, muomu munapu vaka kuhona kuvua. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Munapandele ha ntsimbu ino ngue munapu valongisi, mutonda muntu umo amilongese naua vilongesa viakulivanga via mezi a Njambi. Mucitonda mavele, keti via kulia viakukola, <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />muomu uoshe uje ayoya ha mavele kanda akole mu lizi lia vusunga, muomu napu kanike. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Vuno honi via kulia via kukola vinapu via vaje vanakolo mu mana, kuli vaje vavanalongesa kuhangununa vucili ku vupi.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Nankuma tuyeni lutue ku vilongesa via kukola mu mana, nakuseza vilongesa viakulivanga via muzimbu ua vaka Kilistu. Keti naua tujale luvula lua kutenguluka ku vipangi via vulema kaha tutsilieleni muli Njambi, <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />na vishika via ha kumbuitika, nakusaleka mavoko, na kusanguka ca vatsi, na kusompa ca yaye. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Kaha eci cikeco tukalinga nga Njambi atava.<verse eid="HEB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Muomu cacikalu naua kuhiluisa vaje vatsilieleleho linga vatenguluke, vaje Njambi uatuililile ceke, vaje vamakeleleko vuana vua muilu, kaha vatambuile Cimbembesi Uakulela, <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />kaha vanamakela vucili vua lizi lia Njambi na vua vinzili ya miaka ije ilinakuija, <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />kaha nga vanau, cikapua cacikalu kuvahiluisa ku kutenguluka naua, muomu ya mulonga uavo vavenia valinashukika naua Muna Njambi nakumuhana mukasauntu ku civunga.<verse eid="HEB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Njambi akuisula mavu aje anatumbula mema a kalunga ntsimbu yoshe aje akanokelaho, na kukolesa muacili vimbuto kuli vaje vavilimine. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Vuno honi nga mavu ema mingonga na shaku, kaha anapu angoco kaha vaka asinga, kaha kumamanusuilo vaka atsimika.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Cipue vene tuhandeka ngacije hali yeni vacizango, tunazivuka muacili nguetu mulina viuma viacili vije vinakundama ku kuovoka. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Muomu Njambi keti ua civembulu ngeci ayengule vipangi vieni na cizango cimuamuesele muomu ya ikeye mukupangela vantu vakulela va Njambi, ngue muje hanga mumucili nakulinga. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Kaha tushunguiya umo na umo ueni amuese lukakateya luakulifua noho na kuntsongo ngeci viuma vioshe vimuli nakutsiliela vikapue via vusunga, <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />linga keti mupue vilenda, vuno honi vaka kutemunuina vaje kuhitila mu lutsilielo nakusimpa vakasuana vikulaheso.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vusunga vua cikulaheso ca Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Omo Njambi uapangele cikulaheso kuli Avilahama, muomu kukuakele umo uakuhiana linga alisingileho, ualisingile hali ikeye vavenia, <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />nguendi, “Muavusunga vene njikakukuisula nakukulanesa.” <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Kaha Avilahama, mukusimpa nakuvandamena, uatambuile cikulaheso. <verse eid="HEB 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Cilivene vantu vakalisingila hali uje navahiana, kaha eci cikeco cikamanesa vimpata vioshe. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Kaha omo Njambi uatondele kumuesa cikuma ku vantu vendi cikulaheso cije kuce kutenguluka ha vutumbe vuendi, kaha ualisingile, <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />linga kuhitila ha viuma vivali vije kuvie kutenguluka, ngeci cipue cacikalu Njambi kukuisa, kuli yetu vaje vanauana kuamena linga tukale nakusimpa cakama mukukuata kutsiliela cije vanatutulikila. <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />Tuli neci kupua vusunga na cikongo ca muono, kutsiliela cije cikovela mukati ka ntanga ije ili kunima ya mulili uakulela, <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />kuje Yesu nayi kupua muka kututuamenena, muomu ha kupua kasasendote uakama ua yaye ngue muje muapuile Melekizendeki.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s">Kasasendote Melekizendeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Hali ou Melekizendeki, muene uaku Saleme, kasasendote ua Njambi ua Nzili Yoshe, ualiuanene na Avilahama ahiluka kuhuma ku nzita kuje kua katsihile vimiene kaha uamukuisuile, <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />kaha Avilahama uamuhanene ca vulikumi ku viuma vioshe. Ha kulivanga ualumbunuine lizina liendi nguendi “Muene ua Vusunga,” ambahoni naua nguendi “Muene uaku Saleme,” kulumbununa “Muene ua Ciyulo.” <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Melekizendeki kakele na ishe cipue vaina cipue vakukuluila vendi, kakele na maputukilo a matangua cipue mamanusuilo a muono, vuno honi ualifua ngue Muna Njambi alina kutualelelaho kupua kasasendote ua yaye.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Taleni vukama vuendi havuapua! Avilahama mukakutuluila uamuhanene ca vulikumi ku viuma vioshe vije viambatele ku nzita. <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Kaha nakuli vaje vatekuluila va Levi vaje vakatambula cihela ca vusasendote vaje vavashikile mu lishiko kuambata ca vulikumi ku vantu, eci kulumbununa kuhuminina kuli vamunaina, cipue vene navakevo vapua vatekuluila va Avilahama. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Vuno honi Melekizendeki kakele ku ntanga yavo uatambuile ca vulikumi kuli Avilahama nakumukuisula kuli uje uakele na vikulaheso. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Kucesi na vimpata ngeci uje uamundende vamukuisuile kuli uje uakama. <verse eid="HEB 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Mu ngila imo ca vulikumi vacitambula ku vantu vaje vatsa, kaha mu ngila ikuavo naua vacitambula kuli uje ivatumbula nguavo uayoya. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Umo asa kuhandeka vene nguendi Levi ikeye vavenia, uje ikeye muka kutambula ca vulikumi, uafuetele ca vulikumi kuhitila muli Avilahama, <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />muomu Melekizendeki ualiuanene na Avilahama, tele Levi kanda asemuke.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Honi nga vucili va vuuanene kuhitila mufutisi ya Valevi (muomu ya futisi eyi mukemo vantu vatambuile lishiko), nkuma vika naua vatondelele mukuavo kasasendote linga akaleko hanima ya kuyula ca Melekizendeki, nkuma keti uje ivatumbuile hanima ya kuyula ca Alone? <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Omo nga kuli kutengulula mu futisi ya vusasendote, kaha cacili kutengulula lishiko naua. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Muomu evi viuma vavihandekele kuli muntu uje uakundama ku muyati ueka, muomu naumo uahi uapangelaho laja ku mutula. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Kuya na vukaleho, Muene uetu uahumine ku muyati ua Yunda, kaha mukulipandakana na muyati uje Mosesa kahandekeleho cimo hali vasasendote.<verse eid="HEB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kasasendote ueka uakulifua ngue Melekizendeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Eci cipua honi na vukaleho vuakama muomu kasasendote ueka akeja mucifua ngue ca Melekizendeki, <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />uje napu kasasendote, keti ngue na mashiko cipue vutumbe vua vantu, vuno honi na nzili ya muono ua yaye. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Muomu vanahana vukaleho hali ikeye nguavo, “Unapu kasasendote ua yaye, ngue muje muapuile Melekizendeki.” <verse eid="HEB 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Ku mutambela ukuavo, lishiko lia laja vanalihaka kumukulo muomu liapuile lia kuzeya nakuhona seho. <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />(muomu lishiko kuliapangele viacili), ku mutambela ukuavo, kutsiliela cacili va nacinehe, kaha naua cinatuneha kuyehi na Njambi.<verse eid="HEB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Kaha eci kucakele nakulingiua kuakuhona cisingo. <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />Vaje vasasendote valaja valingile vipangi viavo kuakuhona cisingo, vuno honi ou vamulingile na cisingo nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">“Muene na lisingi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">kaha kakatengulula mana endi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">‘Ukapua kasasendote uayaye.’”<verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />Eci cilingisa Yesu kupua ua vusunga vua litavasano liacili.<verse eid="HEB 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Vaje vasasendote va laja vapuile vavengi cikuma, muomu vavahonouesele ku kutsa linga vatualeleho mu cipangi cavo, <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />vuno honi ikeye nakuatelela vusasendote vuendi vuayaye, muomu ali nakutualelelaho. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Kaha ha ntsimbu yoshe asa kuovola vaje vashuena kuli Njambi kuhitila muli ikeye, muomu ikeye uayoya ntsimbu yoshe linga avalombelele.<verse eid="HEB 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Muomu capande linga tukale na kasasendote uakama, uakulela, uakuhona mulonga, uakuhona vupi, uakulitepa ku vaka vupi, vamujunduile helu lia melu. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Kalingile ngue vaje vasasendote vakama, vakele nakuhana nkombelo ha litangua na litangua, cakulivanga ha vipi vuendi vavenia ambahoni via vaje vantu, ualingile eci lumo kunahu omo ualihanene ngue nkombelo ikeye vavenia. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Cilivene, lishiko likahangula vantu kuya kukuzeya cavo kupua vasasendote vakama, vuno honi lizi lia cisingo, lije liezile hanima tele lishiko kanda likaleko, likahangula Muana uje vapuisa uakulela ntsimbu yoshe.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Kasasendote uetu Uakama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Honi cuma eci tuli nakuhandeka cinapu ngacije, tuli nauje Kasasendote Uakama, uje natumama ku livoko liacilo ku litanda lia Muene ua Nzili yoshe ua muilu, <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />muka kupanga mu cihela cakulela cikuma na mu mbalaka ya vusunga ije vatungile keti ku muntu vuno honi kuli Muene.<verse eid="HEB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Muomu uoshe kasasendote uakama vamuhangula linga ahane mavuana na vinkombelo, kaha capandemo kuli kasasendote naua kukala na cimo linga alinge nkombelo. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Honi nga uakele ha mavu, ngue kapuileho kasasendote, muomu kuakala vasasendote vaje vakakuhana mavuana kusetekesa na lishiko. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Vakapangela cifua na cimbembe ca cihela ca muilu cakulela, muomu Mosesa uatondele kutunga mbalaka ije ya mushikile Njambi nguendi, “Tala, ngeci ulinge vioshe kuya naseteko ije ivakumuesele ha munkinda.” <verse eid="HEB 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Vuno honi kuya nomu cilimo, Kilistu natambula cipangi cakama cikuma kupulakana ca laja ngue litavasano lije lianemanena linapu liacili, muomu litavasano eli linemanena vikulaheso viacili.<verse eid="HEB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Muomu nga litavasano lia kulivanga kuliakele na mulonga, ngue kukuakele naua litavasano lia mu civali. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Muomu Njambi nauana mulonga hali vakevo kaha akahandeka nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">“Matangua akeja, muanahandeka Muene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">omo njikapanga litavasano lialiha na njivo ya Isaleli na njivo ya Yunda.<verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />Keti ngue litavasano lije njalingile na vaishavo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">ha litangua linjavambatele na livoko mukuvatuamenena omo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">vahumine mu cifuti ca Ingito,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">muomu kuvatualeleleho mu litavasano liange,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">kaha kunjovuilile kuli vakevo, muanahandeka Muene.<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Eli likelio litavasano linjikalinga na njivo ya Isaleli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">hanima ya matangua aje, muanahandeka Muene</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Njikahaka mashiko ange mu mana avo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">nakuuasoneka mu mitima yavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">kaha njikapua Njambi yavo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">navo vakapua vantu vange.<verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Kaha ku vakalongesa muntu uoshe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">cipue kuhandeka kuli umo na mukuavo nguavo, ‘Zivuka Muene,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">muomu voshe vakanjizivuka, kuhuma ku uamundende kutuala ku uakama.<verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Muomu njikakala na cikeketima ha vupi vuavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:12">kaha kunjivuluka naua vipi viavo houe.”<verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Hakuhandeka ha litavasano lialiha akalinga lialaja kupua lia kuhona seho. Kaha cije cikapua ca kuhona seho nakukuluvala vuavuno kucikamoneka naua.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s">Kulemesa ca muilu na kulemesa ca ha mavu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Honi cipue litavasano liakulivanga liakele na mashiko a kulemeselamo na cihela cakulela ca ha mavu. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Muomu mbalaka uaitungile, kaha cihela ca hambanza, muje muakele citumbiko ca vindeya na mesa ya mbolo yakulambuila kuli Njambi, cihela cije vacitumbuile nguavo Cihela Cakulela. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Kunima ya ntanga ya mucivali kuakele mbalaka ije vatumbuile nguavo Cihela Cakulela Cikuma. <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />Muje mu cihela muakele mutula ua ngolinde ua kutsimikila ngongosi ya luengo luacili na cikasa ca litavasano viakufuika vioshe na ngolinde, vije viakele na njava ya ngolinde ije yakele na maana, na mbueti ya Alone ije yasokele, na mavue akulipasha haje ha vacokuele visona via litavasano, <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />kaha helu liayo hakele vakelumbi va vumpau vaje vafuikile cituamo ca cikeketima. Ha viuma evi kutuvihandeka honi mukulova.<verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Omo viuma vioshe evi vinahu kuvivuahesa, vasasendote vatualelelaho kuya mu mbalaka ya hambanza, nakulinga vipangi viavo, <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />vuno honi mu mbalaka ya mucivali kasasendote uakama lika ikeye akakovelamo, lumo ha muaka, oku nambata na maninga akulinga nkombelo yendi vavenia neyi ya vipi via vantu. <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Na Cimbembesi Uakulela uje amuesa ngeci ngila yakuya ku Cihela Cakulela kanda vaishokolole kaha mbalaka ya hambanza hanga inemana ngocovene, <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />(eci cinemanena ntsimbu ino vene) Kuya muvana vivuaheselelamo evi, mavuana na vinkombelo vakavikombelela vije kuviasa kulelesa mana a muka kulemesa, <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />vuno honi vikapanga lika na viakulia na viakunua na vikuavo viakuliseza seza, na mashiko a ha muvila kutuala noho ha ntsimbu ya kutenguluka.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Vuno honi omo Kilistu uezile kupua ngue kasasendote uakama ha viuma viacili vije vineja, kaha kuhitila ha vukama na kulela ca mbalaka (keti yakupanga na mavoko, kulumbununa ngeci, keti yakutanga cino) <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />uakovelele lumo lika mu Cihela Cakulela, kakovelele na maninga a vampembe cipue a vana va vangombe vuno honi na maninga endi vavenia, mukututambuila kuovoka ca yaye. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Muomu nga vashamuinine vantu vaka kujuala na maninga a vampembe na a vangombe valuhavo na muto ua muna ngombe uakukombelela ha kulilelesa ca muvila, <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />kaha cikafua vati honi ha maninga a Kilistu, uje kuhitila mu Cimbembesi ua yaye ualilingile nkombelo ikeye vavenia kuakuhona kapenga kuli Njambi, lelesa mana ove ku vipangi via kutsa linga upangele Njambi uakuyoya.<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Nankuma Kilistu napu muka kutuimanenako mu litavasano lia liha, linga vaje vavanasana kuli Njambi vatambule cikulaheso cakusuana ca yaye, muomu kutsa cineja ngeci civamene ku vipi vioshe mu litavasano liakulivanga.<verse eid="HEB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Muomu vusuana kuvuasa kukalako, kuvanga uje liavenia ivasuana natsi. <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />Muomu vusuana vukakala lika na nzili ha kutsa, nga uje vavenia aciyoya kaha vusuana kuvuesi na nzili. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Ngeci vene cipue litavasano lia laja kuliasele kupanga kuakuhona maninga. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Omo kushika coshe ca lishiko vacihandekele kuli Mosesa ku vantu voshe, uambatele maninga a vana va vangombe na a vampembe, na mema na vuanda vua kuvenga na kacishamu ka isope, nakushamuina ha livulu na ku vantu voshe, <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Aua akeuo maninga a litavasano aje Njambi uamishikile.” <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Kaha mu cifua cimo vene uashamuinine maninga ha mbalaka na vitenga vioshe viakulikuasesa mukulemesa. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />Cilivene muintsi lia lishiko lia Mosesa keti viuma vioshe vavilelesa na maninga, kaha cakuhona kuitila maninga ngue kukuesi kukonekela ca vipi.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkombelo ya Kilistu ikeyo ihumisa vupi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Kaha cinapande mikanda ya viuma via muilu kuilelesa, nevi vilika, vuno honi viuma via muilu vikevio vavenia vialihana laja nkombelo yacili kupulakana evi. <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Muomu Kilistu nakovela, keti mu cihela cakulela cakupanga na mavoko a vantu houe, cifua ca vusunga, vuno honi muilu mukemuo vene, kaha akasholoka ku mesho a Njambi mukuimanena yetu. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Kilistu ikeye kalihanene vavenia kuhilukila, ngue kasasendote uakama uje akakovela mu Cihela Cakulela ha muaka na muaka na maninga aje keti endi. <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />Muomu nga ngoco ngue uayandele kuhilukila nakuhiluka hume ha luvula lua mavu. Vuno honi omu mucilimo, uasholokele lumo lika kunahu kutuala kumamanusuilo a ntsimbu yoshe linga amanese vupi mukulilinga ikeye vavenia nkombelo. <verse eid="HEB 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Kaha ngue muje muvanacihanguila ha vantu kutsa lumo, kaha kuhuma haje kuija cisompelo, <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />mungila imo vene Kilistu ha kumuhana kupua nkombelo lumo mukuambata vipi via vavengi, akasholoka naua lua mucivali, keti kuija nakuhumisa vipi houe, vuno honi mukuovola vaje vanamuvandamena.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Muomu lishiko lia Mosesa likelio cimbembe ca viuma viacili vije vili nakuija keti ngue mu cifua ca vusunga cevi viuma, kucikalingiua, ha vinkombelo viakulifua vije vivakakombelela kutualelelaho ha muaka na muaka, ije ikapuisa vusunga vaje vashuena muyehi. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Ngue ngoconi, nkuma ngue kuvalikelele ku valinga nkombelo ndi? Nga vaka kulemesa vavalelesele laja, kaha ngue kuvali shoshomuene naua mulonga ua vipi. <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Vuno honi ha vinkombelo evi hali civulukiso ca vupi ha muaka na muaka. <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />Muomu capua cacikalu maninga a vangombe va vankomba na vampembe kuhumisa vipi.<verse eid="HEB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Nankuma, omo Kilistu uezile hano ha mavu, uahandekele nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">“Vinkombelo na milambu kuuavitondele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">vuno honi uanjivuaheselele muvila,<verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />mu milambu ya kutsimika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">na milambu ya vupi vioshe kuvia kuvuahelesele.<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Kaha njahandekele nguange, ‘Njineja nakulinga cizango cove, Njambi yange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">ngue muje vanacisoneka hali yange mu livulu liakuzenga.’”<verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Omo uahandekele ha kulivanga nguendi, “Yove kuuazangele cipue kuvuahelela mu vinkombelo na milambu na milambu yakutsimika na milambu ya vupi” (evi vakavikombelela kuya ku lishiko lia Mosesa), <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />kaha uatualeleho kuhandeka naua nguendi, “Tala, njineja nakulinga cizango cove.” Uamanusuile vinkombelo viakulivanga linga anehe nkombelo ya mucivali. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Kaha ha vukaleho vuje vanatulelesa kuhitila mu nkombelo ya muvila ua Yesu Kilistu lumo lika kunahu.<verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Kasasendote uoshe ha litangua na litangua akayi kuvipangi viendi mukuhana vinkombelo viakulifua, vije kuviasa kuhumisa vipi. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Vuno honi omo Kilistu uahanene nkombelo imo lika ya ntsimbu yoshe ya vipi, uatumamene ku livoko liacilio lia Njambi, <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />mukuvandamena kuvanga noho vitozi vendi vavapuise cituamo ca viliato viendi. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Muomu ha nkombelo imo nalelesa cikuma voshe vaje vanalele.<verse eid="HEB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Kaha Cimbembesi Uakulela naikeye naua ahana vukaleho kuli yetu, hanima yakuhandeka nguendi,<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />“Eli likelio litavasano linjikapanga navo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">hanima ya matangua aje, muanahandeka Muene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Njikahaka mashiko ange mu mitima yavo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">nakuuasoneka mu mana avo.”<verse eid="HEB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />kaha naua uatualeleleho kuhandeka nguendi, “Kunjikavuluka vipi viavo na vilinga viavo via vipi naua.” <verse eid="HEB 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Haje hali cikonekelo ha viuma evi, kukuesi naua nkombelo ya vupi.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tuyeni tushuene muyehi na Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Nankuma, vamuanetu muomu tunasimpi mukukovela mu Cihela Cakulela ha maninga a Yesu, <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />ha ngila yaiha na kuyoya caciha vije viatushokoluelele Kilistu kuhitila mu ntanga yakufuika ha civumbe, ikeyo ije kuhitila mu muvila uendi ua ntsitu, <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />kaha muomu tulina kasasendote uakama cikuma uje endesa njivo ya Njambi, <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />tushueneni muyehi na mutima ua vusunga mukushula na vusunga vua lutsilielo, na mitima yetu ije ivanalelesa ku mana a vupi na mivila yetu ije ivanakushu na mema akulela. <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Tuyeni tukuatelele ngoo mukulitava ca kutsiliela cetu cakuhona kutaliangela muomu uje uatukulahesele uapua uakulongua. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Kaha tuyeni tulikolese umo na mukuavo muku lizanga na mu vipangi viacili, <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />keti muyengule kuliuana hamo ngue muje muvakalingi vamo, vuno honi lisimpiseni umo na mukuavo, na kutualelelaho ntsimbu yoshe ngue muje munamono ngueni Litangua lia Muene lilinakushuena muyehi.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Muomu nga tulinga vupi mu cizango cetu hanima yakutambula mana a vusunga, kaha kukuesi naua nkombelo yakuhumisa vipi, <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />vuno honi liova lia kusompa, na litende lia tuhia lije lika tsimika vitozi. <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Muntu uje nashaula lishiko lia Mosesa atsa cakuhona cikeketima ca vukaleho vua vantu vavali cipue vatatu kupua vakaleho. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Kakapua hali kashitiko kausinganieka kavakahana kuli muntu uje nashaula Muna Njambi, na kupopolola maninga a litavasano aje alelesele, kaha anienguesa Cimbembesi ua kavumbi? <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Muomu tumuzivuka uje uahandekele nguendi, “Kulingula capua cange, njikafueta,” Kaha naua, “Muene akasompa vantu vendi.” <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />Cinapu cuma cakuteuesa cikuma kuuila mu mavoko a Njambi ua kuyoya.<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Vuno honi vuluka matangua akunima, omo hanima yakumimuesa ceke, muahianene vukalu na tuyando, <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />vintsimbu vimo vakele nakumishaula mutania muelu na kumiyandesa, kaha naua mu vintsimbu vimo muakele nakukalahamo navaje vavakele nakuyandesa. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Muomu muakele na cikeketima hali vinzinda, kaha muajolele ha kutambula vufuko vueni vuje vuazimbalele, muomu muazivukile ngueni yeni vavenia muli na vufuko vuacili vuje vukatumama ntsimbu yoshe. <verse eid="HEB 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Nankuma keti muecele kusimpa ceni, cije cili na vuana vuakama cikuma. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Muomu munapande kukakateya, ngeci mulinge cizango ca Njambi nakutambula vije vianakulahesa. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />Ngue muje muvihandeka visoneka nguavio,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">“Muomu ka ntsimbu kakandende lika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">kaha uje akeja, akeja</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">cakuhona kusimbula,<verse eid="HEB 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />vuno honi vantu vange vaka vusunga vakayoya ha lutsilielo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">kaha nga ahilukila munima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">muono uange ku ukavuahelela muli ikeye.”<verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Vuno honi keti yetu vaje vakakuhilukila munima na kutunongesa, vuno honi vaje vali na lutsilielo nakutulika miono yavo.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s">Lutsilielo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Honi lutsilielo lukeluo vusunga vua viuma vije tutsiliela, vukaleho vua viuma vije kutumono. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Muomu ya lutsilielo vantu vakulaja Njambi uavatambuile.<verse eid="HEB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />Kuhitila mu lutsilielo tunevuisisa nguetu mavu va atangele na lizi lia Njambi, ngeci vije vimoneka vavipangele ha viuma vije kuvisholoka.<verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />Kuhitila mu lutsilielo Avele ualambuile nkombelo ije yatevele Njambi kupulakana ya Kaine. Muomu ya ikeyo vamutambuile kupua ua vusunga kaha na Njambi uahanene vukaleho hakutambula mavuana endi, uatsile, vuno honi kuhitila mu lutsilielo luendi hanga acili nakuhandeka.<verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />Kuhitila mu lutsilielo Inoke vamutualele muilu linga keti atse, kaha kuvamuuanene naua, muomu Njambi ikeye uamuambatele. Honi tele kanda vamuambate ikeye vamutumbuile nguavo umo uje uavuahelesele Njambi. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Kaha kuakuhona lutsilielo cacikalu kuvuahelesa Njambi. Muomu uoshe uje ashuena kuyehi na Njambi napande kutsiliela nguendi kuakala, kaha naua akahana mavuana kuli vaje valina kumutonda.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />Kuhitila mu lutsilielo Noua omo vamunanguile kuli Njambi ha viuma vije kanda acimone, uononokele kaha uashongele vuato muje muvovokelele ikeye na ntanga yendi, mu ngila eyi vene mavu vahisile kaha uapuile suana ya vusunga vuje vukeja kuhitila mu lutsilielo.<verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />Kuhitila mu lutsilielo Avilahama uononokele omo vamusanene linga aye ku cihela cije capandele kukatambula kusuana, kaha uayile kuakuhona kuzivuka kuje kuaya. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />Kuhitila mu lutsilielo Avilahama uakapangele limbo liendi ku cihela cije civamukulahesele ngue ngenzi mu cifuti ca vungezi, uayoyele mu vintsingi na Isake na Yakomba, vaje vasuanene nendi cikulaheso ca cifua cimo. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Muomu ikeye uatalele kulutue lia nganda ije yakala na mavula aje mukaku atunga naku apanga ikeye Njambi.<verse eid="HEB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />Kuhitila mu lutsilielo Sala uatambuile nzili ya kuimita cipue vene tele nakuluvala, muomu uakele na lutsilielo hali uje uamukulahesele. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Nankuma kuhuma kuli yala umo, uje tele amoneka ngue natsi, kuasemukile vatekuluila vavengi ngue vintanga ntanga via muilu na vinona viakuhona kutanda via museke seke ua livu liaku ntunda ya cisali.<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Voshe ava vatsile mu lutsilielo, cakuhona kutambula cije civa vavakulahesele, vuno honi muomu vacimuene vacimenekele tele cilikulahako, kaha hanima ya kulimona nguavo vapuile vangenzi na vaka kuenda hano ha mavu. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Muomu vantu vaje vahandeka viuma evi vamuesa nguavo vali nakutonda cifuti cavo. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Nga vakele nakusinganieka cihela cije kuvahumine, ngue vakele nakapandi kakuhilukako. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Vuno honi omu mucilimo, vakashunguiya cifuti cacili, cikeco cije ca muilu. Nankuma Njambi kevu shuamua mukumutumbula nguavo Njambi yavo, muomu navavuahesela laja nganda.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />Kuhitila mu lutsilielo Avilahama, omo vamuesekele, ualambuile Isake ngue nkombelo, kaha ikeye uatambuile cikulaheso kaha ualivuaheselele kuhana nkombelo munendi uje umo lika, <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />hali ikeye uahandekele nguendi, “Kuhitila muli Isake vatekuluila vove vakavaluka.” <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />Avilahama uazivukile nguendi Njambi asa kusangula vantu cipue ku vatsi, kuhandeka muavusunga, uamutambuile naua.<verse eid="HEB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Kuhitila mu lutsilielo Isake uahanene vikuisulo via kulutue kuli Yakomba na Isau.<verse eid="HEB 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />Kuhitila mu lutsilielo Yakomba omo uatsile, uakuisuile vana va Yosefa umo na umo, uakotamenene ha mutue ua mbueti yendi mukulemesa.<verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />Kuhitila mu lutsilielo Yosefa omo uakele kuyehi na kutsa, uahandekele ha vungenzi vua Vaisaleli nakuvaleka mu ngila ivanapande ku mutsindilamo.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />Kuhitila mu lutsilielo Mosesa, omo uasemukile vamushuekele ha vingonde vitatu kuli visemi vendi, muomu vamuene nguavo muanike uacili, kaha kuvakele na liova nevi viahandekele muene.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Kuhitila mu lutsilielo Mosesa omo uakolele, uavianene kumutumbula nguavo vaina muna Falao, <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />uahanguile kulipangela tuyando na vantu va Njambi kupulakana kulinga viuma vituala ku vupi. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />Uacimuene nguendi kasauntu ka kuyanda muomu ya Kilistu cinapu vufuko vuakama kupulakana vufuko vua mu Ingito, muomu uavandamenene kutambula vuana kulutue.<verse eid="HEB 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Kuhitila mu lutsilielo Mosesa uasezele Ingito, kateuele vukalu vua muene, muomu uakolesele ngue namono Njambi uje kutuekumona. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />Kuhitila mu lutsilielo Mosesa uaniungile Paseka na kushamuina maninga, linga Muka kupihisa vana va vamala va vantuatua keti akuate vana Vaisaleli.<verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />Kuhitila mu lutsilielo vantu vajavukile ndonga ya kuvenga ngue ha mavu akuma, vuno honi vaka Ingito, omo vesekele kulinga muje, kaha voshe vanongele. <verse eid="HEB 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />Kuhitila mu lutsilielo vivumbe via Yeliko viauile ha mavu hanima ya kuvizenguluka vantu va Isaleli ha matangua atanu na avali. <verse eid="HEB 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />Kuhitila mu lutsilielo Lahave uje cikuizi katsile navaje kuvononokele, muomu ualingile vusamba vuakutambula vaje vaka kunenga cije cifuti.<verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Nkuma njikahandeka vati honi? Kunjesi na ntsimbu ya kuleka Ngilioni, na Mbalake, na Samusoni, na Njefeta, na Ndaviti na Samuele na tunanguizi, <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />vaje kuhitila mu lutsilielo vahianene vimiene, valingile via vusunga, vatambuile vikulaheso, vashokele tunua tua vandumba, <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />vazimine tuhia tua vukalu, vaputumukile kukuvatapa ku mukuale, vakele na nzili kuhuma kukuzeya, vapuile vaka nzili yakama mu nzita, vahianene masualale va vangenzi kaha vateuele. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />Vampuevo vatambuile vaka kutsa muvasangukile.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 11:35">Vamo vavayandesele cikuma, na kuviana kutambula kuzituka, linga vahinduke naua ku muono uacili. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Vamo vayandele na ku vashendumuna na kuvapupa, kaha na kuvakuta na malienge na kuvahaka mu kamenga. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />Vavashele mavue, vavatetangele hakati, kaha vavatsihile na mukuale, vendanganene mu vilambu via vampanga na vampembe, na kuhutuua, nakuvapangesa mua mupi, <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />kuli vakevo mavu kakele naseho vendanganene mu vimpambo na ha minkinda, na mu vipuku na mu vina via kucokola mu mavue aha mavu.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Kaha vioshe evi, cipue vene va vavesekele na lutsilielo luavo, vuno honi kuvatambuile vije viva vakulahesele, <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />muomu honi Njambi uamuene cuma cacili hali yetu, kaha kuvanga hamolika netu ambahoni navakevo vakavapuisa va vusunga.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s">Njambi Tatetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Nankuma, muomu civunga cakama ca vakaleho cina tuzenguluka, kaha netu naua tusezeni cuma coshe cakulema, na vupi vuje vuatukakateya, kaha tuyeni tushatuke nakukakateya seteko ije vanatuhakela kulutue, <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />oku tutala kuli Yesu ikeye uje muka kututuamenena na kulingisa lutsilielo luetu vusunga, uje omo yanzolela ije ivamuhanene kaha uasimpile ha cilindakano, kovuile shuamua, kaha natumama ku livoko liacilo ku litanda lia Njambi.<verse eid="HEB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Singaniekeni hali ikeye uje uasimpile kuli vaka vupi mu vamuyandeselelemo, linga keti muzeye cipue kuhona. <verse eid="HEB 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Mu tuyando tueni hakuluisa vupi kanda mucihete ha ntsimbu yakumuania maninga eni. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Kaha nkuma uasuvu eli lizi lia kukolesa lije livakamisana ngue Njambi akahandeka na munendi ndi? Lije lihandeka ngualio,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">“Munange, keti usembulule ha kukulongesa mana kuli Muene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">kaha keti uzeye omo akuhana kashitiko.<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />Muomu Muene akalongesa mana kuli uje yazanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">kaha akahana kashitiko kuli muana uoshe uje yakatambula.”<verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Cinapu muomu ya kumilongesa mana ngeci muli nakuyanda. Njambi ali na kumilongesa mana ngue vana vendi, muomu nkuma kuli muana uje ishe kekulongesa mana ndi? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Kaha nga vamiecela cakuhona kumilongesa mana ngue muje muvakalingi voshe, kaha munapu vana vamu vupangala keti vana va vusunga. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Kumutambela ukuavo, tuakele na vatatetu vaha mavu vaje vasele kutulongesa mana kaha tuavasingimikile. Kaha nkuma kutuapandele kukundama cikuma kuli Tatetu ua vimbembesi na kuyoya ndi? <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Muomu vatulongesele mana mu kantsimbu kakandende mukuvuahelesa vakevo vavenia, vuno honi ikeye atulongesa linga tuuane viacili, ngeci tulipangele kulela cendi hamo. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Muomu ha ntsimbu yaindende vilongesa via mana vivuisa kuvavala kupulakana kuvua vuino, vuno honi hanima yevi vikanehe vushuka vua ciyulo vua vusunga kuli vaje vavanalongesa ku vikevio.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vishika na vinangulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Nankuma junduleni mavoko eni akuua akuhona nzili kaha koleseni mavuli eni akuzeya, <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />kaha sungameseni vingila omo ya viliato vieni, linga uoshe cilema keti va muhangunune kuva kuavo vuno honi linga akanguke.<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Lingeni muoshe muje muamuaselamo kulinga ciyulo na vantu voshe, kuakuhona kulela kaha naumo uahi akamona Muene. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Taleni ngeci naumo uahi napande kuhonoua kutambula kavumbi ka Njambi, “linga keti kukale muzi ua kushasha” ukasoke nakuneha vukalu, kaha omo yavio vavengi vakapua vakujuala, <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />ngeci naumo uahi alinge vupangala cipue kukala na mutima uakuhona vu Kilistu ngue Isau, uje ualandesele kapandi kendi ka vukuluntu ha cakulia cimo. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Muomu muazivuka ngueni hanima yevi, omo uatondele kusuana vikuisulo, vuno honi vamuvianene, muomu kauanene ntsimbu ya kutenguluka ku vipi viendi cipue vene ualilile.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Muomu kumuezile ku munkinda uje umunapande kukuata, uje uakushukuma na tuhia, na milima, naku lishuashuata, na mpunzi yakama cikuma, <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />na cililimo ca tolombita, na lizi lia mezi aje alingisile vaka kuivuilila nguavo keti vevue muzimbu ukuavo naua uje uvakahandeka kuli vakevo. <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />Muomu kuvasimpile nakushika cije civavahanene, “Cipue vene cikashama nga akakuata ha munkinda, vaka mutsiha na mavue.” <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Cilivene, cije camuene Mosesa cateuesele cikuma kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Njili nakujaja naliova.”<verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Vuno honi muneja ku Munkinda ua Siyone na ku nganda ya Njambi ua kuyoya, Yelusalema ya muilu, na tungelo vavengi cikuma vanakunguluka hamo, <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />kaha ku cikungulukilo ca muana ua ntuatua vaje mazina avo vana asoneka muilu, na kuli Njambi uje muka kusompa ua viuma vioshe, na vimbembesi via vantu va vusunga vanavipuisa kupua vusunga, <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />kaha kuli Yesu, uje muka kuimanena litavasano lialiha, kaha naku maninga aje akushamuina aje akahandeka cikuma via kavumbi kupulakana maninga a Avele.<verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Taleni ngeci keti mumuviane uje ali nakuhandeka. Muomu nga kuvateuele omo vamuvianene uje ua vananguile hano ha mavu, kaha yetu tukateua vati nga tuviana uje akatunangula ua muilu. <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />Ambahoni lizi liendi lianingangesele mavu, vuno honi na kulahesa nguendi, “Kunjika ningangesaho mavu lika vuno honi na melu.” <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Lizi eli “Naua,” limanena kuhumisa vije vininganga linga honi vije viakuhona kuninganga visaleho. <verse eid="HEB 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Nankuma tuyeni tutsantsele ha kutambula vumuene vuje kuvue kuninganga, kaha honi tuyeni tulambuile kuli Njambi kulemesa cije casa kutambula na kasingimiko na liova, <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />muomu Njambi yetu uapua tuhia tuakunongesa.<verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s">Muje mutunapande kuvuahelesa Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Vamuanetu tutualeleniho kulizanga umo na kuavo. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />Keti muecele kutambula vangenzi, muomu vamo vatambuile tungelo cakuhona kuzivuka. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Vulukeni vaje vali mu kamenga ngue neni muli hamo navo mu kamenga, na vaje vavali nakuyandesa cikuma, muomu neni naua muli mu vuntu. <verse eid="HEB 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Eceleni vulo muvuambate mukasingimiko hakati keni voshe, kaha keti mujualese muhela ua vulo, muomu Njambi a kasompa vakakulinga vukuizi na vupangala. <verse eid="HEB 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Humiseni vuyoye vueni ku cizango ca vimbongo, kaha puisenimo na viuma vije vimulinavio, muomu ikeye nahandeka nguendi, “Kunji kamihonoua cipue kumiseza.” <verse eid="HEB 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />Nankuma tuhandeka na kusimpa nguetu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">“Muene ikeye mukuasi uange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">kunjikevu liova,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">nkuma muntu alinga vika kuli yange?”<verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Vulukeni vantuama veni, vaje vahandekele kuli yeni lizi lia Njambi, singaniekeni viahumine ha vuyoye vuavo, kaha temunuineni lutsilielo luavo. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Yesu Kilistu uapua umo lika izau na lelo na miaka yoshe ya yaye. <verse eid="HEB 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Keti vamitangule na vieka na vilongesa via vungenzi, muomu capua cacili linga mutima vaukolese na kavumbi, keti na viakulia vije kuviesi na seho. <verse eid="HEB 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Tuli na mutula uje vaje vaka kupanga mu mbalaka kuvesi nakapandi kakulilako. <verse eid="HEB 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Muomu mivila ya vaje tusitu vaje maninga avo aje avananeha mu cihela ca kulela kuli kasasendote uakama kupua nkombelo ya vupi vaka auemekela hambanza lia cilombo. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Mu ngila imo vene na Yesu naua uayandelele hambanza lia cilombo linga a lelese vantu kuhitila mu maninga endi. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Nankuma tuyeni kuli ikeye hambanza lia cilombo, tukevue shuamua ije yevuile. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Muomu kuno kutuesi na nganda ya yaye, vuno honi tuli na kutonda nganda ije ili nakuija. <verse eid="HEB 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Ambahoni kuhitila muli ikeye tuyeni tutualeleleho kuhana nkombelo ya kushangazala kuli Njambi, ije ikeyo vushuka vua tunua tuje tuzivuka lizina liendi. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />Keti mulikele kulinga viacili kaha lipangeleni vije vimuli navio, muomu vinkombelo evi vikavuahelesa Njambi. <verse eid="HEB 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Ononokeni vantuama veni kaha lihaneneni kuli vakevo, muomu vali na kuminiungilako miono yeni, ngue vamala vaje vakahana vukaleho. Eceleni valinge eci na nzolela keti nakuniengua, keti ngoconi cikapua ca kuhona seho kuli yeni.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Tulombeleleni, muomu cilivene tuazivuka nguetu tulina visinganieka via vusunga, tukashunguiya kulinga viuma vioshe mukasingimiko. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Njimilambelela cikuma kulinga eci linga njihiluke kuli yeni vuavuno.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilombelo liakushoka nalio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Honi Njambi ua ciyulo uje kuhitila ha maninga a litavasano lia yaye uahiluisile Muene uetu Yesu kuhuma ku vatsi, uje Kaniungi Uakama ua vampanga, <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />amihane viuma vioshe viacili linga mulinge cizango cendi, apange muli yeni vije vimuvuahelesa ku mesho endi, kuhitila muli Yesu Kilistu, kuli ikeye kukale vumpau vua miaka ya yaye. Ameni.<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mezi amamanusuilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Vamuanetu njimilambelela nguange, ivueni ku lizi liange lia kumikolesa, muomu njamisonekela lika muvuihi. <verse eid="HEB 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Munapande kuzivuka ngeci muanetu Timateo vana muhumisa mu kamenga, nga eja vuavuno kaha njikeja nendi linga tuakumimone.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Menekeni va ntuama veni voshe na vantu va kulela va Njambi. Vantu vaje vahuma ku Itali vanamitumu vihindu. <verse eid="HEB 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Kavumbi kakale neni voshe. Ameni.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>